Data tables taken from specifications:

The character encodings are decoded by go-fast-core's charset package,
which was this library's internal/charset; character references are
resolved by its entity package (this library's internal/entity, with the
WHATWG table), and MHTML is read with its rfc822 package (this library's
internal/mimepart, a copy of go-fast-email's). Their tables and sources
are listed in go-fast-core's NOTICE.

testdata/encoding
  Copies of some of go-fast-core charset's testdata/detect: texts written
  for these tests.

internal/css/color.go (colorNames)
  The named colors (section 6.1) and system colors (section 6.2) of the
  W3C CSS Color Module Level 4, https://www.w3.org/TR/css-color-4/,
  (c) World Wide Web Consortium. Only the names are used.